---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Work & Money Math"
  description="What Work & Money Math is, who it's for, and how the free calculators work."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <article class="prose panel">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Work &amp; Money Math</strong> is a free calculator hub for freelancers, contractors, and side
      hustlers. It helps with everyday money questions: day rates, project fees, platform cuts, runway, and
      rough take-home toys.
    </p>
    <p>
      Everything runs in your browser. There are no accounts and no paid APIs in this MVP. Inputs stay on your
      device for the calculation — we do not need them to serve the page.
    </p>
    <h2>Important labels</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Tax and take-home tools are <strong>illustrative estimates, not advice</strong>.</li>
      <li>Laws, GST/VAT, and employment rules differ by country and situation.</li>
      <li>For real decisions, talk to a qualified professional.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Roadmap (honest)</h2>
    <p>
      The site may later include privacy-friendly analytics, ads, or affiliate links so it can stay free. Any
      paid “Pro” features would be optional extras (for example exports), not a paywall on the core math.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
